#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1286
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Killer job! You've walked %d steps today which is %d%% above your typical. "
"Do it again tomorrow and you'll be on top of the world!"
msgstr ""
"Paráda! Dnes už máte %d kroků, což je o %d %% víc než obvykle. Zopakujte to "
"zítra a budete na vrcholu světa!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1289
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Nice moves! You've walked %d steps today which is %d%% above your typical. "
"Crush it again tomorrow 😀"
msgstr ""
"Skvělé! Dnes už máte %d kroků, což je o %d %% víc než obvykle. Zítra to "
"dejte znovu 😀"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1291
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Hey rockstar 🎤 You've walked %d steps today which is %d%% above your "
"typical. Nothing can stop you!"
msgstr ""
"To je výkon 🎤 Dnes už máte %d kroků, což je o %d %% víc než obvykle. Nic vás"
" nezastaví!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1293
#, c-format
msgid ""
"We can barely keep up! You walked %d steps today which is %d%% above your "
"typical. You're on 🔥"
msgstr ""
"Sotva vám stačíme! Dnes už máte %d kroků, což je o %d %% víc než obvykle. "
"Jedete naplno 🔥"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1296
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps today which is %d%% above your typical. You just "
"outstepped YOURSELF. Mic drop."
msgstr ""
"Dnes už máte %d kroků, což je o %d %% víc než obvykle. Překonáváte svůj "
"vlastní výkon. Paráda."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1305
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps today; keep it up! Being active is the key to feeling "
"like a million bucks. Try to beat your typical tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Dnes už máte %d kroků; jen tak dál! Pohyb je klíčem ke skvělému pocitu. "
"Zkuste zítra překonat svůj obvyklý počet."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1308
#, c-format
msgid "Good job! You walked %d steps today–do it again tomorrow."
msgstr "Dobrá práce! Dnes už máte %d kroků – zopakujte to zítra."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1309
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Someone's on the move 👊 You walked %d steps today; keep doing what you're "
"doing!"
msgstr "Někdo je v pohybu 👊 Dnes už máte %d kroků; jen tak dál!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1311
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You keep moving, we'll keep counting! You've clocked in %d steps today. Keep"
" it rolling, hot stuff."
msgstr "Vy se hýbete, my počítáme! Dnes už máte %d kroků. Jen tak dál."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1320
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps today which is %d%% below your typical. Try to be more "
"active tomorrow–you can do it!"
msgstr ""
"Dnes už máte %d kroků, což je o %d %% méně než obvykle. Zkuste být zítra "
"aktivnější – zvládnete to!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1323
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps which is %d%% below your typical. Being active makes you"
" feel amaaaazing–try to get back on track tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Jste na %d krocích, což je o %d %% méně než obvykle. Pohyb dělá divy – "
"zkuste se zítra vrátit do tempa."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1325
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps today which is %d%% below your typical. Don't worry, "
"tomorrow is just around the corner 😀"
msgstr ""
"Dnes už máte %d kroků, což je o %d %% méně než obvykle. Nevadí, zítra je "
"nový den 😀"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1327
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps which is %d%% below your typical, but don't stress. "
"You'll crush it tomorrow 😉"
msgstr ""
"Jste na %d krocích, což je o %d %% méně než obvykle, ale žádný stres. Zítra "
"to rozjedete 😉"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1334
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps today. Don't fret, you can get back on track in no time "
"😉"
msgstr ""
"Dnes už máte %d kroků. Nic se neděje, do tempa se můžete vrátit raz dva 😉"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1336
#, c-format
msgid "You walked %d steps today. Good news is the sky's the limit!"
msgstr "Dnes už máte %d kroků. Zítra můžete jít ještě dál!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1337
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You walked %d steps today. Try to take even more steps tomorrow–show us what"
" you're made of!"
msgstr ""
"Dnes už máte %d kroků. Zkuste jich zítra udělat ještě víc – ukažte, co ve "
"vás je!"

#. / Sleep notification on wake up, slept above their typical sleep duration
#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1389
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Refreshed? You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% above your typical. Go tackle"
" your day 😃."
msgstr ""
"Cítíte se odpočatě? Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% víc než"
" obvykle. Hurá do nového dne 😃."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1391
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You caught some killer zzz’s! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% above your"
" typical. Keep it up."
msgstr ""
"To byl pořádný spánek! Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% víc "
"než obvykle. Jen tak dál."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1393
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Rise and shine! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% above your typical. Do "
"it again tonight, sleep master."
msgstr ""
"Vzhůru do nového dne! Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% víc "
"než obvykle. Zopakujte to i dnes v noci."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1396
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Mmmm...what a night. You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% above your typical."
" That's gotta feel good!"
msgstr ""
"Mmm… to byla noc. Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% víc než "
"obvykle. To musí být příjemný pocit!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1399
#, c-format
msgid ""
"That's a lot of sheep you just counted! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% "
"above your typical. Boom shakalaka."
msgstr ""
"Těch oveček ale bylo! Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% víc "
"než obvykle. Paráda."

#. / Sleep notification on wake up, slept similar to their typical sleep
#. duration
#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1409
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Good mornin’. You slept for %dH %dM. Every good day begins with a solid "
"night’s sleep...kinda like that one 😉 Keep it up!"
msgstr ""
"Dobré ráno. Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku. Každý dobrý den začíná "
"pořádným spánkem… přesně jako tenhle 😉 Jen tak dál!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1412
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Good morning! You slept for %dH %dM. Consistency is key; keep doing what "
"you're doing 😃."
msgstr ""
"Dobré ráno! Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku. Pravidelnost je základ; jen "
"tak dál 😃."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1415
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You're rockin' the shut eye! You slept for %dH %dM. Make it a nightly "
"ritual. You deserve it."
msgstr ""
"Spánek vám jde! Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku. Udělejte z toho každonoční"
" rituál. Zasloužíte si to."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1417
#, c-format
msgid "Feelin' good? You slept for %dH %dM. Nothing can stop you now 👊"
msgstr ""
"Cítíte se dobře? Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku. Teď vás nic nezastaví 👊"

#. / Sleep notification on wake up, slept below their typical sleep duration
#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1426
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Hey sleepy head. You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. Try"
" to get more tonight!"
msgstr ""
"Ospalé ráno? Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% méně než "
"obvykle. Zkuste dnes spát déle!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1428
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Groggy? You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. Sleep is "
"important for everything you do-try getting more shut eye tonight!"
msgstr ""
"Cítíte únavu? Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% méně než "
"obvykle. Spánek je důležitý pro všechno, co děláte – zkuste dnes spát déle!"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1430
#, c-format
msgid ""
"It's a new day! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. It's"
" not your best, but there's always tonight."
msgstr ""
"Je tu nový den! Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% méně než "
"obvykle. Nebyl to nejlepší výsledek, ale večer je další šance."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1433
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Goooood morning! You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. Go "
"crush your day and then get back in bed 😉"
msgstr ""
"Dobré ráááno! Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% méně než "
"obvykle. Zvládněte dnešek a pak zase hurá do postele 😉"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1440
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. Sleep is vital for "
"all your great ideas–how 'bout getting more tonight?"
msgstr ""
"Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% méně než obvykle. Spánek je"
" důležitý pro všechny vaše skvělé nápady – zkuste si ho dnes dopřát víc."

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1442
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You only slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. We know you're "
"busy, but try getting more tonight. We believe in you 😉"
msgstr ""
"Máte za sebou jen %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% méně než obvykle. Víme,"
" že máte napilno, ale zkuste dnes spát déle. Věříme vám 😉"

#: fw/services/activity/activity_insights.c:1444
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You slept for %dH %dM which is %d%% below your typical. We know stuff "
"happens; take another crack at it tonight."
msgstr ""
"Máte za sebou %d h %d min spánku, což je o %d %% méně než obvykle. To se "
"stává; zkuste to dnes večer znovu."

